2:["$","div",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"article_main__3JoSm","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"article_container__IXwt_","children":[["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/blog/an-anthology-2","className":"article_breadcrumb__FwgXp","children":"An Anthology of Joy and Thought Vol. 2"}],["$","$La",null,{"className":"article_image__AX8h9","src":"/blog/an-anthology-2/8.jpg","width":600,"height":600,"alt":"article image"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article_credit__UV7Cg","children":"Image: Stephen Noh"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"article_title__rQyxE","children":"wait"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article_text__ZR1Ez","children":["Acts 1, Jesus calls us to wait. To wait on Him. To wait on His promise.",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],"This ",["$","q",null,{"children":"waiting"}]," is what I feel the season I am in right now. Waiting for new work or to be married. Not saying that I am on hiatus until one of these happens, but waiting in the sense that these events are my new big ",["$","q",null,{"children":"checkpoints."}]," They divide my seasons. They may be long, they may be short. Who knows. But what I do know is what I am called to do in this moment. He calls me to wait on Him. To pray, to seek, to chase after His presence. Praying is waiting on the Lord.",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],"Bring to Him your desires, your fears.",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],"Wait.",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],"On.",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],"Him.",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],"Serve.",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],"Him.",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],"Witness.",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],"Him."]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article_buttons__mebIq","children":[["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/blog/an-anthology-2/7","className":"article_href__Xfeux","children":"<  Previous"}],["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/blog/an-anthology-2/9","className":"article_href__Xf